CC   IMGT/LIGM-DB annotation level: by annotators
CC   
CC   For an overview of the musigdjc loci see the first paragraph of
CC   'comment' in musigdjc01. For a rundown of the alternative mRNA
CC   processing pathways of the c-delta region see the second paragraph
CC   of 'comment' in musigdjc14.
CC       Exon c-delta-3 is not, in fact, the third domain of the c-delta
CC   gene. It is the second, but it shares a strong homology with the
CC   human c-delta-3 region and so it has been similarly named. The
CC   c-delta-2 domain is entirely missing from mouse igd genes. For the
CC   other c-delta gene exons see musigdjc14, musigdjc15 & musigdjc17.
